  "reason": "No experiments have been completed, so the main uncertainty is whether a simple RNA-only, single-profile model provides a useful performance baseline. config_001 tests this minimal setup using PCA, without aggregation, learned encoders, image features, or fusion, which helps isolate the effect of the basic RNA representation and profile setting. It is the best first experiment because it is simple, likely fast, and establishes a reference point for later comparisons of multiprofile aggregation, learned RNA encoders, image-only models, and multimodal fusion."
